git add .gitignore
git commit -m "chore: add comprehensive .gitignore file

Added patterns to exclude:
- Binary document files (*.docx, *.doc, *.pdf)
- IDE files (.vscode/, .idea/, *.swp, *.swo)
- Database files (*.mdf, *.ldf, *.bak)
- Python cache (__pycache__/, *.pyc)
- Node.js modules (node_modules/)
- Log files (*.log)
- Temporary files (tmp/, temp/)

This ensures only source code and documentation
are committed to the repository.

This is commit #2 of 20."
